## Task

Deduplicate and reconcile findings across the activated slots. Emit
a single consolidated markdown report the design author can read
without touching individual slot outputs.

Also emit `open_questions`: every question the research left
unresolved and the design author must decide or defer.

## Output

```bash
LOOM=~/.kiro/skills/home/loomv2/scripts/loom.sh
$LOOM output init "{{ input.__loom.workdir }}" --task research-merge
$LOOM output add  "{{ input.__loom.workdir }}" --task research-merge \
    --set report='<consolidated markdown report>' \
    --set 'open_questions[]=<question 1>' \
    --set 'open_questions[]=<question 2>'
```
